messages.content:
{
  "thought_summary": "首先需要确认目标文件 hanoi.py 的内容，以了解汉诺塔实现的逻辑，然后检查其是否正确生成移动序列。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "hanoi.py",
      "start_line": 1,
      "context_lines": 50,
      "max_lines": 100
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "观察到 hanoi 函数的实现逻辑，它递归地将圆盘从起始柱移动到目标柱，但可能存在错误导致移动序列不正确。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "run_tests",
    "arguments": {
      "scope": "target"
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "测试失败表明 hanoi 函数生成的移动序列与预期不符，需要进一步检查函数逻辑，特别是递归调用和辅助柱的选择。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "hanoi.py",
      "start_line": 4,
      "context_lines": 10,
      "max_lines": 20
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "hanoi 函数的逻辑似乎有问题，特别是在选择辅助柱时，可能导致移动序列不正确。需要进一步验证辅助柱的计算方式。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "search_code",
    "arguments": {
      "query": "helper = \\({1, 2, 3} - {start} - {end}\\).pop()",
      "path": "hanoi.py",
      "regex": true,
      "case_sensitive": false,
      "max_results": 1
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "搜索代码时出现错误，可能是因为路径不正确。需要重新检查路径并确保其指向正确的目录。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "list_files",
    "arguments": {
      "path": ".",
      "max_depth": 1,
      "max_entries": 10
    }
  }
}

{
  "thought_summary": "确认了文件路径和内容，现在可以进一步分析辅助柱的计算方式是否正确。",
  "action": {
    "type": "tool",
    "tool_name": "inspect_code",
    "arguments": {
      "file_path": "hanoi.py",
      "start_line": 4,
      "context_lines": 10,
      "max_lines": 20
    }
  }
}

